    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in the horrors of a cursed village where La Llorona roams. In this 4v1 asymmetrical multiplayer horror experience, four players take on the role of survivors performing ancient rituals to survive, while one becomes the vengeful ghost. Use strategy, teamwork, and spiritual tools to banish the spirit or escape her wrath. Inspired by Latin American legends, this game combines intense tension, dynamic gameplay, and supernatural powers in an unforgettable haunting.",
